WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.694
- Well, your dad is of course, Arnold.

00:00:01.694 --> 00:00:02.970
Does he ever use...

00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:04.400
This as a real question.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.930
Does he ever use any of
his like iconic lines

00:00:06.930 --> 00:00:09.077
like just casually?
- Yeah.

00:00:09.077 --> 00:00:11.380
(audience laughing)
- 'Cause we all wanna know.

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:12.360
- Everybody asks that.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:14.400
They're like, "Does
your dad like always say

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.930
like his one-liners," and
I'm like, "All the time."

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:19.070
- Like, I hope that every
time he exits a room,

00:00:19.070 --> 00:00:19.903
he says, "I'll be back."
- He does.

00:00:19.903 --> 00:00:20.960
He'll turn back, and be
like, "I'll be back."

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:22.320
I'll be like, "Dad,
really? Like, come on."

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:23.870
- You're over it but we think it's funny.

00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:24.703
- I know.

00:00:24.703 --> 00:00:26.900
Other people do, but
sometimes, like, a little kid,

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:29.430
like a six-year-old, the dad
will kind of shove the kid

00:00:29.430 --> 00:00:31.252
to go get an autograph
from my dad or something.

00:00:31.252 --> 00:00:33.240
The kid probably has no idea who my dad is

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:35.080
and goes up and like asks for something

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:36.260
and my dad will just like scream

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:37.820
one of the one-liners at him.

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:39.937
And the kid's like, "What?
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:39.937 --> 00:00:41.400
"I don't know, I don't know what that is."

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:42.972
- It's a test. You have
to earn the autograph.

00:00:42.972 --> 00:00:44.700
You have to know the film.

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:46.053
That's actually a good idea.

